          "comment": "# Comfy Sonilo- Video Soundtrack Generation\n\nGenerate synchronized soundtracks from video footage. Input a video to produce music that matches its pacing and emotional cues, outputting a perfectly timed audio file. Runs on Comfy Cloud and needs Comfy Cloud partner credits.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete template graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its outputs.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt or the Load node inputs and run again to compare results.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/templates/api_sonilo_v2m.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
